Draco 3D Data Compression, decoder
https://github.com/google/draco

draco_decoder.wasm and draco_wasm_wrapper.js in this directory are the glTF
variant of the Draco decoder, byte-identical to the copies three.js ships in
examples/jsm/libs/draco/gltf/ (three 0.186.0). They are served unmodified.

